0..77 Comment "// Rules stated under a row of theories. A rule written `under [T | r]` fires"
78..150 Comment "// only where the row a program runs in holds `T` and possibly more; one"
151..226 Comment "// written `under [T]` only where the row holds exactly `T`. Two such rules"
227..302 Comment "// overlapping owe a join only in the rows both describe, the meet of their"
303..380 Comment "// rows, and there by the rules firing in each of those rows; two rules whose"
381..457 Comment "// rows share none owe nothing. A row is a set of theories, as an effect row"
458..481 Comment "// is a set of effects."
483..509 Comment "// The theory `State.Eff`."
510..516 Keyword "import"
517..518 StringLit "\""
518..531 StringLit "./state.gandr"
531..532 StringLit "\""
532..533 Other ";"
535..612 Comment "/// Writes that go nowhere: a theory of no operation, which a row holds where"
613..646 Comment "/// what is written is discarded."
